Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:05.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,300前暗塌谷帝國和藍天大地締結了和平條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:10.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 Cure Noble卻背叛了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,殺害了我父皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:22.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的絕不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:02:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}守護吧英雄！我們的城市！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:12.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble背叛了女帝他們？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:14.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是女帝她的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不像是在說謊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:28.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那是從藍天大地人民的流言蜚語裡開始的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽別人的 皇帝·暗塌谷都活了幾百年了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要是真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天淚公主不在了 皇帝背叛了我們該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天就是世界毀滅的日子了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我自己做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想做什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於藍天大地來說 這麼做才是正義
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天淚！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你算計我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:45.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble也想奪走我的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:50.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好一人之下救了我 帶我回了帝國
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:54.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我便發誓一定要復仇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:58.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就從出現在我面前的你開始...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,從Cure Noble送來的你開始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要親手幹掉你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:09.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信大公主送我的這份溫暖的禮物！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:12.44,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble絕不會做這種事！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先處理一下傷口吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不是傷口在痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:26.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,而是我的心在流血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.39,0:04:32.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經一無所有了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:37.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可以信任的人 父皇 還有我愛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:41.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有能夠紓解這痛楚的事物了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大海啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量之海啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,將我的一切都獻給你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:04:59.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,招來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:07.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:19.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,能把藍天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:25.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,連帶著你們Precure一併抹除的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:28.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,搭上我這具肉體也無所謂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:32.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝·暗塌谷已不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:53.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量！是我的名號！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:02.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 振作一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:07.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,把暗塌谷能量和女帝切割開來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:10.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡虹光！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都已經跨越了種種危機 不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:17.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:18.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:20.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼辦吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:20.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.78,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
