Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:22.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.19,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.19,CurePri,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:22.60,CureSky,,0,0,0,,
