Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:41.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,速度的力量 飛揚起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀吧！稜鏡虹光！
