Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:12.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,白忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:16.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:21.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們見識一下 什麼才是真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
