Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:27.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,城裡的人們有危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:46.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky Majesty 這裡就交給你們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我回城裡保護人們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing你跟我一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:54.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能夠修復護罩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:56.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能做到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:57.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來擋住女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:00.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:03.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,用你的稜鏡虹光照亮女帝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！對女帝不起作用啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:11.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續試啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:16.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,找出被黑暗吞噬的女帝的心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有你的柔光能夠辦到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:22.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 你可以辦到的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:36.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要照亮 女帝善良的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:49.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快進城堡裡去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快進通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這邊世界是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和由由博士預測的一樣嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通道消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還有家人留在藍天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通道無法支撐這麼多人往來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠過來避難的 這就是極限了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 保護好人們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯啊 莉虹莓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副隊長的水準也算是夠看了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶飛吻！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Kiss！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,護罩的情況！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:12.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,幻鏡平板護罩 維護模式！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:25.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要修復！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:39.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再打了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還不足夠大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,現在放出稜鏡虹光的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:13:59.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定會跟剛才一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:01.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:03.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你冷靜下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能跟她耗上個一整天！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:12.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,開闊起來吧 我的稜鏡虹光！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要奪回女帝的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:25.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:27.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:31.13,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:35.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一記！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:55.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦...啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好臭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:07.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,見識到了吧 開闊瓦斯屁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關鍵點在於 要積攢一週的屁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:16.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久違了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:22.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來報恩了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這拳頭是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鍛鍊以後 就能發光了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:30.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,護罩壞了是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也得虧這情況 才能打開通道趕過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！那也就是說...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓城裡的人們通過你們的通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經在做了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不覺得我本性其實還挺善良的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實是“難能可貴”的性格
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被誇獎了 自我肯定感上升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有誇你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}該怎麼說呢... 形象點說吧，兩個人的說法都在採訪犯人鄰居時會聽到的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過暗塌谷帝國的通道 也沒有讓城裡全部人去避難的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要鬆懈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 謝謝你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你繼續做你該做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:17.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:20.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們做我們的事 卡疤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵 我們說不定正意外地在成為英雄的道路上呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:37.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了靠自己在天空飛行的夢想...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:45.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這個夢想闊展開來 我成為了公主的騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,成為了由由阿姨那樣的賢者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:52.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在夢想闊展的過程中 結識了很多伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:55.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,而現在我有了這樣一個夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要和大伙一起 守護這個世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:09.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶撲擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:09.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（護罩破裂聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:31.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:33.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:17:59.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,太亂來了！身體會撐不住的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:17.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,游刃有餘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不該是這樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:26.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,明明不該是這樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:30.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly可是守護大家的Precure啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 包括你的夢想...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會守護好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:47.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可以守護好大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:08.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不懶啊 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:11.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是不是該別叫"少年"了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:14.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 少年就是少年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:17.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對我來說 你永遠都是少年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫忙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:34.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！想要守護人們的信念 已經超越了暗塌谷能量的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:40.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！這不就證明了！力量並非是一切啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了... 像我這種弱者 也保護了父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下 父皇是不是明白了 力量並非一切...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀吧！稜鏡虹光！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1050,960)}Prism Shine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:28.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:30.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
